BearSSL 0.6, unmodified: src/, inc/ and LICENSE.txt (MIT) from
https://bearssl.org/bearssl-0.6.tar.gz
sha256 6705bba1714961b41a728dfc5debbe348d2966c117649392f8c8139efc83ff14

Built into build/user/libbearssl.a by the Makefile; configuration is passed as -D flags
(BR_USE_URANDOM, BR_USE_UNIX_TIME, no x86 intrinsics), so src/config.h stays stock.
VibeOS's TLS wrapper is user/lib/tls.c (user/include/tls.h).
